.TH GROOT 1 "2026-08-04" "groot v1.0.6" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
groot \- collect Kubernetes logs and cluster context into one archive
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B groot
[\fIglobal flags\fR]
.I command
[\fIcommand flags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B groot
is a read-only Kubernetes diagnostics CLI.
It gathers logs, events, and selected API snapshots into a timestamped
.B .tar.gz
archive for incident response and RCA.
Collection uses
.B client-go
end-to-end; no
.B kubectl
binary is required at runtime.
.PP
The same program is also shipped as
.B kubectl-groot
so kubectl can invoke it as
.BR "kubectl groot" .
See
.BR kubectl-groot (1).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B collect
Run a collection into a
.B .tar.gz
archive (primary workflow).
.TP
.B validate
Preflight checks (config, cluster, RBAC, disk) without collecting.
.TP
.B inspect \fIarchive.tar.gz\fR
Inspect an existing groot archive (manifest and file tree).
.TP
.B notify test
Send a test notification without running collect.
.TP
.B completion \fIbash|zsh|fish|powershell\fR
Generate a shell completion script.
.TP
.B version
Print version information.
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-config " " \fIpath\fR
Path to YAML configuration (see
.B FILES
and
.BR SPECIFICATIONS.md
in the project docs).
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print version and exit (same payload as
.BR "groot version" ).
.TP
.B \-\-verbose
Enable verbose logging.
.TP
.B \-\-quiet
Reduce log noise.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-color
Disable ANSI colors.
.TP
.B \-\-kubeconfig \fIpath\fR
Override kubeconfig path for this invocation.
.TP
.B \-\-print\-sample\-config
Print a sample YAML config to stdout and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-test\-connection
Verify Kubernetes connectivity and exit.
.SH COLLECT OPTIONS
Common flags for
.B groot collect
(see
.B groot collect \-\-help
for the full list):
.TP
.B \-\-since \fIduration\fR
Limit pod log history (for example
.BR 1h ,
.BR 30m ).
.TP
.B \-\-summary
Print a human-readable summary footer after collect.
.TP
.B \-\-output \fIjson\fR
Emit machine-readable collect result JSON (when supported).
.TP
.B \-\-no\-notify
Skip configured notifications after collect.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-upload
Skip configured S3/GCS/SFTP upload after collect.
.TP
.B \-\-strict
Exit non-zero when collect reports partial job failures.
.TP
.B \-\-list\-jobs
List collect jobs from config and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-message \fItext\fR
Optional operator message included in notify payloads.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.B groot
uses distinct exit codes for scripting (see project
.B SPECIFICATIONS.md
). Broadly: success, usage/config errors, Kubernetes client failures, and
optional strict-mode partial-failure exits.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ./groot.yml
Default config search path (and other locations documented in SPEC).
.TP
.I /etc/groot/groot.yml.sample
Example config installed by
.B .deb
/
.B .rpm
packages (
.BR config|noreplace
on upgrades). Not auto-loaded; copy or pass
.BR \-\-config .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kubectl-groot (1),
project documentation at
.I https://github.com/hrodrig/groot
(README, SPECIFICATIONS.md), and operator deployment examples in
.BR groot-selfhosted .
.SH AUTHORS
Maintained by hrodrig and contributors.
